@startuml
autonumber
skinparam style strictuml

actor "Usuário/Visitante" as User
participant "Frontend" as UI

box "Backend" #f9f9f9
    participant "Camada de Interface" as CI
    participant "Camada de Negócio" as CN
    participant "Camada de Dados" as CD
end box

box "Infra" #e8f4f8
    participant "PostgreSQL (DB)" as DB
end box

== Fluxo: Visualizar Feed com Filtros ==

User -> UI : Aplica filtros (lat, lng, pet_type)
activate UI
UI -> CI : GET /posts?lat=x&lng=y&pet_type=pet_type
activate CI
CI -> CN : Buscar Posts Filtrados (params)
activate CN
CN -> CD : Query Customizada
activate CD
CD -> DB : SELECT * FROM posts WHERE...
activate DB
DB --> CD : lista_posts
deactivate DB
CD --> CN : lista_posts
deactivate CD
CN -> CN : Formata dados (URLs das imagens)
CN --> CI : JSON(posts_list)
deactivate CN
CI --> UI : 200 OK
UI --> User : Renderiza cards no Feed
deactivate UI

== Fluxo: Visualizar Mapa ==

User -> UI : Clica na aba Mapa
activate UI
UI -> CI : GET /map/pins
CI -> CN : Obter coordenadas (status=active)
activate CN
CN -> CD : Busca coordenadas e IDs
activate CD
CD -> DB : SELECT id, lat, lng FROM posts
activate DB
DB --> CD : geo_data
deactivate DB
CD --> CN : geo_data
deactivate CD
CN --> CI : geo_json
deactivate CN
CI --> UI : 200 OK
UI --> User : Renderiza Pins no Mapa
deactivate UI
@enduml